Subject: [PATCH 208/260] [ae-patch] Show a chat's live Claude login in the
 Usage card, with a switcher for the other subscriptions

The runner labels the session with the login its terminal launches on, so the box knows it at every launch instead of waiting for the host relay. A new chat names the picked login, and the card's account name opens a menu of the box's Claude logins.
